      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Frequeqntly asked questions\n- how do I import another file (OOP) is it like __init__.py?\n- what are fundamentals?\n    - data types\n        - str\n        - int\n        - float\n        - bool\n    - logic flow\n        - if/else\n        - try/except/finally/else\n    - error handling\n        - assert\n        - try/except/raise\n        - if __name__ == \"__main__\"\n\n- what are data structures and algorithims\n    - ... machine learning?\n    - ... deep learning?\n    - ... cuda? (NVIDIA GPU)\n    - ... XLA? (Google TPU)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Frequeqntly asked questions\n- how do I import another file (OOP) is it like __init__.py?\n- what are fundamentals?\n    - data types\n        - str\n        - int\n        - float\n        - bool\n    - logic flow\n        - if/else\n        - try/except/finally/else\n    - error handling\n        - assert\n        - try/except/raise\n        - if __name__ == \"__main__\"\n\n- what are data structures and algorithims\n    - ... machine learning?\n    - ... deep learning?\n    - ... cuda? (NVIDIA GPU)\n    - ... XLA? (Google TPU)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aO"
    },
    {
      "id": "KfYfcbXOEBhEak6GghksU",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": -2270.5057945452118,
