      "updated": 1784678458619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Roadmap\n2: cuda kernel to understand fundamental concepts (GPU arhictecture, memory, warps, blocks)\n\n3: building blods of neural networks from scratch (identify parralism)\n\n4: full end-to-end training pipeline (identify areas of optimization)\n\n*from training to inference 5: transformer architrecutre: autoregression, KV caching, Mixture of Experts\n\n6: profiling bottlenecks, systematic approach to optimizing kernels\n\n7: tensor cores (specialized hardware) to accelerate matrix operateions\n\n*8: flash attention\n\n*9: quantization, memory compression without performance loss\n\n10: multiple GPU orchestration\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Roadmap\n2: cuda kernel to understand fundamental concepts (GPU arhictecture, memory, warps, blocks)\n\n3: building blods of neural networks from scratch (identify parralism)\n\n4: full end-to-end training pipeline (identify areas of optimization)\n\n*from training to inference 5: transformer architrecutre: autoregression, KV caching, Mixture of Experts\n\n6: profiling bottlenecks, systematic approach to optimizing kernels\n\n7: tensor cores (specialized hardware) to accelerate matrix operateions\n\n*8: flash attention\n\n*9: quantization, memory compression without performance loss\n\n10: multiple GPU orchestration\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
