      "seed": 90786071,
      "version": 647,
      "versionNonce": 1595410740,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784678458619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CH 12.3: vLLM\n    - high throughput inference with efficient memory management\n    - Paged Attention\n    - Key-Value cache management\n    - paying to allocate memory dynamically as needed\n    - continous batch approach: processes requests as they arrive\n    - supports tensor parrallenism and openAI compatible (XPU)\n\n    - LLM focused (vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM): Autoreressive decoding, KV cache\n        - ONNX is the portability layer for everything else\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CH 12.3: vLLM\n    - high throughput inference with efficient memory management\n    - Paged Attention\n    - Key-Value cache management\n    - paying to allocate memory dynamically as needed\n    - continous batch approach: processes requests as they arrive\n    - supports tensor parrallenism and openAI compatible (XPU)\n\n    - LLM focused (vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM): Autoreressive decoding, KV cache\n        - ONNX is the portability layer for everything else\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AqqwafRhOT_u85_ETxqbE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11740.549035219803,
      "y": -2514.702254066322,
      "width": 514.15966796875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "CS4m5clLlJch_PMWiidFi",
      "index": "aTzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 766205497,
      "version": 357,
      "versionNonce": 1160729612,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784678458619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chp 12.5 cuda is the base\n    - C++, Python\n    - PyTorch\n    - JAX is worth learning as part of the ecosystem\n    - for TPU:\n        - openXLA\n        - StableHLO\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
