    {
      "id": "1I1aRz845oznHAEXsCb_r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3472.072104071929,
      "y": 1604.8862494193104,
      "width": 1581.558837890625,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "AEQ930Y-_u31L1FU_AhV-",
      "index": "b04zzzz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1165208371,
      "version": 1338,
      "versionNonce": 926802227,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785258390379,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KV Caching\nFlash Attention (v1 through v3); NVIDIA Hopper, Blackwell \nvLLM (paged attention)\n    -> What is attention? (Q, K, V)\n    -> HBM handoff back and forth\nFamiliarity with the compounding optimization layers: Clusters of GPU > Quantization > Flash attention > tesnorCore > Memory OPtimization > Naive Cuda\n\nFundamentals\n    - threads (NVIDIA warps (32 threads), AMD wavefront (64 threads)) -> blocks (of threads) -> grids (of blocks)\nGEMM (matrix-matrix) to GEMV (matrix-vector) -> Transformer io\nTensorCore: WMMA/WGMA\n    - PCIe vs. NVLink\nQuantization and their types (in reality a mix)\n    - static, dynamic, symmetric\n\nMixture of Experts\n    - a selection of feedforward neural networks in the transformer architecture with various predefined weights that are selected from previous routing softmax\n\nFundamental NLP Transformer terminology\n    - head\n    - attention",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KV Caching\nFlash Attention (v1 through v3); NVIDIA Hopper, Blackwell \nvLLM (paged attention)\n    -> What is attention? (Q, K, V)\n    -> HBM handoff back and forth\nFamiliarity with the compounding optimization layers: Clusters of GPU > Quantization > Flash attention > tesnorCore > Memory OPtimization > Naive Cuda\n\nFundamentals\n    - threads (NVIDIA warps (32 threads), AMD wavefront (64 threads)) -> blocks (of threads) -> grids (of blocks)\nGEMM (matrix-matrix) to GEMV (matrix-vector) -> Transformer io\nTensorCore: WMMA/WGMA\n    - PCIe vs. NVLink\nQuantization and their types (in reality a mix)\n    - static, dynamic, symmetric\n\nMixture of Experts\n    - a selection of feedforward neural networks in the transformer architecture with various predefined weights that are selected from previous routing softmax\n\nFundamental NLP Transformer terminology\n    - head\n    - attention",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XA9xd3l2vttXxtMErYnsa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4919.572104071929,
      "y": 1202.3862494193104,
      "width": 398.2796630859375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "AEQ930Y-_u31L1FU_AhV-",
      "index": "b04zzzzV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2072163485,
      "version": 151,
      "versionNonce": 1756180701,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785258434638,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Benchmark (Pytorch)\n2. Replicate (CUDA; under the hood)\n3. Optimize\n    - Leverage hardware specific features",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Benchmark (Pytorch)\n2. Replicate (CUDA; under the hood)\n3. Optimize\n    - Leverage hardware specific features",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AEQ930Y-_u31L1FU_AhV-",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 3367.9714070987566,
      "y": 1067.8014943927,
      "width": 2142.7434357977168,
      "height": 1123.7480469785212,
      "name": "GPU Glossary (CUDA, Deep Learning (Transformer))",
